Package: nfs-utils
Version: 1.3.1-r0
Description: userspace utilities for kernel nfs
 The nfs-utils package provides a daemon for the kernel NFS server and
 related tools.
Section: console/network
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Poky <poky@yoctoproject.org>
License: MIT & GPLv2+ & BSD
Architecture: cortexa9-vfp-neon
OE: nfs-utils
Homepage: http://nfs.sourceforge.net/
Depends: libblkid1 (>= 2.25.2), nfs-utils-client, libwrap0 (>= 7.6), libc6 (>= 2.21), initscripts-functions, bash
Recommends: update-rc.d, kernel-module-nfsd
